lla in Cantabria. She manages nutritional care for patients with diabetes and other related conditions, providing essential nutritional support specifically for diabetic patients suffering from head and neck cancer. Her expertise encompasses a comprehensive approach to nutritional management, ensuring that her patients receive tailored care to address their unique health needs.", "DR. MIGUEL LEÓN SANZ:Dr. Miguel León Sanz is a prominent figure in the medical field, recognized for his contributions to endocrinology and nutrition. He serves as the head of the endocrinology and nutrition service at Hospital Universitario 12 de Octubre in Madrid, where he plays a crucial role in advancing medical practices and research in these specialties. Additionally, Dr. León Sanz is an author, further demonstrating his commitment to the dissemination of knowledge within the medical community.", "DR. FRANCISCO LOSFABLOS CALLAU:Dr. Francisco Losfablos Callau is a medical specialist in endocrinology and nutrition, currently practicing at Hospital Universitario Miguel Servet in Zaragoza. He is recognized for his expertise in the field and has contributed to the medical community as a co-author of articles focused on diabetes mellitus.", "DR. DANIEL A. DE LUIS ROMÁN:Dr. Daniel A. de Luis Román is the scientific director and head of the endocrinology and nutrition service at Hospital Clínico Universitario de Valladolid. In this role, he oversees the department's operations and contributes to advancements in the field of endocrinology and nutrition.", "DRA. ÁNGELA MARTÍN PALMERO:Dra. Ángela Martín Palmero is the head of the Clinical Nutrition and Dietetics Unit at Hospital San Pedro in La Rioja. In her role, she emphasizes the management of diabetes and addresses issues related to disease-related malnutrition, ensuring comprehensive care for her patients.", "DR. JUAN FRANCISCO MERINO TORRES:Dr. Juan Francisco Merino Torres is a distinguished medical doctor specializing in endocrinology and nutrition. He serves as the head of the Endocrinology and Nutrition department at Hospital Universitario y Politécnico La Fe in Valencia, where he also holds the position of director científico. Dr. Merino Torres is recognized for his expertise in the field, particularly in relation to diabetes mellitus, and has contributed to the medical community through various published articles on the subject. His leadership at the hospital underscores his commitment to advancing the understanding and treatment of endocrine and nutritional disorders.", "DRA. ROSA Mª MIRETE LÓPEZ:Dra. Rosa Mª Mirete López is a medical specialist in endocrinology and nutrition at Hospital Universitario de San Juan in Alicante. She is known for her expertise in treating patients with diabetes mellitus and inflammatory bowel disease, providing specialized care to manage these conditions effectively.", "DRA. MARÍA JOSÉ MOLINA PUERTA:Dra. María José Molina Puerta is a medical specialist in endocrinology and nutrition at Hospital Universitario Reina Sofía in Córdoba. She is also an author of a clinical case that discusses the interrelated issues of morbid obesity, diabetes, and bariatric surgery, highlighting her expertise in these critical areas of health.", "DRA. JULIA OCÓN BRETÓN:Dra. Julia Ocón Bretón is a specialist in clinical nutrition and endocrinology at the Hospital Clínico Universitario Lozano Blesa in Zaragoza. She is responsible for the Clinical Nutrition and Dietetics Unit at this hospital, where she focuses on medical nutritional therapy.", "DR. CHRISTIAN SALOM VENDRELL:Dr. Christian Salom Vendrell is a medical doctor specializing in endocrinology and nutrition at Hospital Universitario Doctor Peset in Valencia. He focuses on providing nutritional support for patients with head and neck cancer, demonstrating his expertise in managing the dietary needs of this specific patient population. Additionally, he has been involved in clinical cases, including enteral nutrition for a diabetic patient diagnosed with laryngeal squamous cell carcinoma. Through his work, Dr. Vendrell plays a crucial role in integrating nutritional care into the treatment plans for patients facing complex health challenges.", "DR. ÁNGEL LUIS ABAD GONZÁLEZ:Dr. Ángel Luis Abad González is a medical specialist in Endocrinology and Nutrition, currently practicing at the Hospital General Universitario de Alicante. He specializes in treating patients with diabetes and other related conditions. Additionally, he is involved in clinical cases, including those related to gastrostomy.", "COMPLEJO ASISTENCIAL UNIVERSITARIO DE LEÓN:", "HOSPITAL GENERAL UNIVERSITARIO SANTA LUCÍA, CARTAGENA:", "HOSPITAL CLÍNICO UNIVERSITARIO LOZANO BLESAS:Hospital Clínico Universitario Lozano Blesa is a clinical institution located in Zaragoza, Spain. It specializes in clinical nutrition and dietetics, as well as endocrinology. The hospital is directed by Dra. Julia Ocón Bretón, who oversees its focus on providing comprehensive care in these medical fields."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}